sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T23:43:14-07:00","id":1393972,"title":"","content":"That's cool, was just curious. To be honest, I only really care about monkey and thousand blades. Monkey because this time round the wheel it's inspired by Sun Wukong. And blades 'cuz...hell yeah! that's why.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24445-arkayriel","name":"Arkayriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"122"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-03T23:44:19-07:00","id":1393973,"title":"","content":"It's like heirs of the shogunate for DB's, it's the lunar companion book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24445-arkayriel","name":"Arkayriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"122"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-04T01:20:58-07:00","id":1393984,"title":"","content":"It is the Lunars' companion book.<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>kickstarter</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Many-Faced Strangers:</b> A companion volume to <i>Lunars</i> which includes additional Charms, an animal bestiary, heroes of the Silver Pact, martial arts, fiction, War for the Caul, the Shadow Fang Vanguard, Quick Characters, Magic of the Moon, Mount Namas.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-04T01:52:35-07:00","id":1393990,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't expect it anytime soon though, as it's behind Heirs to the Shogunate, Crucible of Legends, Exigents and Across the Eight Directions (IIRC, in that orders, but I am not sure).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-04T07:44:57-07:00","id":1394028,"title":"","content":"Toad style is immensely strong and immune to nearly any weapon. When it's properly used it's almost invincible!<br /> <br /> Did they settle on calling it Poison Toad? I know Vance said it's directly inspired by 5 Deadly Venoms, which would mean less poison and more offensive iron body.<br /> <br /> One step closer to my Venom Mob circle... just need Scorpion and Lizard. (Tough there's a really damn good fan made Scorpion)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i