t what Sun Wukong's influence would be, I feel like Laughing Monster and Lunar charms have him fairly covered.</div> </div> </div> </div>Extendo-staff?<br /> <br /> Or the way he fights in the umpteen Chinese kung-fu shows featuring him.<br /> <br /> (Anyone watch the new-ish Monkey show on Netflix? Any good?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 06-05-2020, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-05T14:35:24-07:00","id":1394437,"title":"","content":"Lunar Charms for Sun Wukong's inherent abilities; the powers at his disposal without his staff.<br /> <br /> Evocations for powers arising directly from Sun Wukong's magical staff.<br /> <br /> Celestial Monkey Style specifically for the staff-fighting techniques that Sun Wukong could use with literally any other staff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-05T18:08:06-07:00","id":1394466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bb